sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
----
statement: Similar parallelepipedal solids are to one another in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides.
----
----
proof:

Let *AB* and *CD* be similar parallelepipedal solids, and let *AE* be the side corresponding to *CF.*

I say that the solid *AB* has to the solid *CD* the ratio triplicate of that which *AE* has to *CF.*

Produce *EK, EL,* and *EM* in a straight line with *AE, GE,* and *HE.* Make *EK* equal to *CF, EL* equal to *FN,* and *EM* equal to *FR.* Complete the parallelogram *KL* and the solid *KP.* [!just I.3; I.31]

